---
// 独立 404 页面：复用站内样式 main.css 和主题脚本 /js/core.js，
// 不套用 Layout（无需导航/hero/toast 等）；404 特有样式单独放 404.css
import '../styles/main.css';
import '../styles/404.css';
---

<html lang="zh-CN" data-pagefind-ignore>
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
		<title>404 - Page Not Found</title>
		<!-- Google Fonts（替代原 CSS @import：link 并行加载 + preconnect 提前握手） -->
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&family=Encode+Sans+SC:wght@100..900&family=Encode+Sans:wght@100..900&family=Google+Sans+Flex:opsz,wght@6..144,1..1000&family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,100..800;1,100..800&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@100..900&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@200..900&family=Playfair+Display+SC:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400;1,700;1,900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..900;1,400..900&display=swap" />
		<script src="/js/core.js" is:inline></script>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="content-section">
			<section class="container">
				<section class="section-content">
					<h1 class="error-title">404</h1>
					<div class="error-tagline" style="margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;">
						<p>抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。</p>
					</div>
					<div style="margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-sub); text-align: justify;">
						<p>乐章里好像没有这个音……请检查链接是否正确，或者点击下方按钮返回首页。</p>
						<p>如需反馈网页内容问题，请前往 <a href="https://github.com/KabulMus/MyWebsite/issues" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary-blue); text-decoration: none;">GitHub</a> 提交 issue，或通过 <a href="mailto:ethanshaw@ethan929.com" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary-blue); text-decoration: none;">电子邮箱</a> 联系我。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="error-tagline" style="margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: left;">
						<p style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 6px;">Sorry, the page you are looking for doesn't exist or has been moved.</p>
					</div>
					<div style="margin-bottom: 35px; color: var(--text-sub); text-align: left;">
						<p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">It seems this note isn't in the score… Please check the URL or click below to return home.</p>
						<p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">If you need to report any issues with the website content, please submit an issue on <a href="https://github.com/KabulMus/MyWebsite/issues" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary-blue); text-decoration: none;">GitHub</a> or contact me via <a href="mailto:ethanshaw@ethan929.com" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary-blue); text-decoration: none;">email</a>.</p>
					</div>
					<a href="/" class="modal-btn">返回首页 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Back Home</a>
				</section>

				<footer>
					<p>© 2026 Ethan Shaw</p>
					<p>Built with love for Charlie and you all</p>
				</footer>
			</section>
		</main>

		<button class="theme-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()" aria-label="切换亮暗模式">
			<span class="icon-sun">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48">
					<path d="M9.15039 9.15088L11.3778 11.3783" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 24H6.15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9.15039 38.8495L11.3778 36.6221" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M38.8495 38.8495L36.6221 36.6221" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M44.9996 24H41.8496" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M38.8495 9.15088L36.6221 11.3783" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 3V6.15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 36C30.6274 36 36 30.6274 36 24C36 17.3726 30.6274 12 24 12C17.3726 12 12 17.3726 12 24 12C30.6274 12 36 17.3726 36 24Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 45.0001V41.8501" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
				</svg>
			</span>
			<span class="icon-moon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48">
					<path d="M28.0527 4.41085C22.5828 5.83695 18.5455 10.8106 18.5455 16.7273C18.5455 23.7564 24.2436 29.4545 31.2727 29.4545C37.1894 29.4545 42.1631 25.4172 43.5891 19.9473C43.8585 21.256 44 22.6115 44 24C44 35.0457 35.0457 44 24 44C12.9543 44 4 35.0457 4 24C4 12.9543 12.9543 4 24 4C25.3885 4 26.744 4.14149 28.0527 4.41085Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
				</svg>
			</span>
		</button>
	</body>
</html>
